---
args: { scope: DisputeScope, pages: EvidencePage[] }
returns: DisputeChronology
---
Align transaction-time listing editions, later edits, buyer/seller statements, shipping records and submissions. Attribute each statement to its speaker and source version. A timestamp establishes when a record was logged, not necessarily that the event it describes occurred. Preserve assertions, independent records, contradictions and searched-partition gaps separately.
